tile.betteroplenty.lavender.desc=A fragrant purple bloom. Grind it into purple dye.
tile.betteroplenty.wheat.grass.desc=Tall golden grass. Shears will keep it intact.
tile.betteroplenty.amethyst.ore.desc=A violet crystal embedded in stone.
tile.betteroplenty.amethyst.block.desc=A solid block of amethyst.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst.desc=A violet gem, cut from stone deep underground.
item.betteroplenty.mudball.desc=A handful of packed mud. Throw it, or press four back into a block.
item.betteroplenty.wood_scythe.desc=Clears the grass and flowers a block around you.
item.betteroplenty.stone_scythe.desc=Clears the grass and flowers a block around you.
item.betteroplenty.iron_scythe.desc=Clears two blocks around you, leaves included.
item.betteroplenty.gold_scythe.desc=Clears two blocks around you, leaves included.
item.betteroplenty.diamond_scythe.desc=Clears three blocks around you, leaves included.
item.betteroplenty.mud_scythe.desc=Clears a block around you, and not for long.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_scythe.desc=Clears three blocks around you, and dulls slower than diamond.
item.betteroplenty.steel_scythe.desc=Clears four blocks around you, and keeps on clearing.
item.betteroplenty.dart_blower.desc=A tube of river cane. Fires darts, sixty-three times.
item.betteroplenty.dart.desc=A thorn on a cane shaft. Ammunition for a dart blower.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_pickaxe.desc=Pick some stone with this amethyst tool.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_shovel.desc=Dig up the dirt with this amethyst tool.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_axe.desc=Chop some trees with this amethyst tool.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_sword.desc=Slay pesky monsters with this sharp amethyst blade.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_hoe.desc=Till the land with this amethyst tool.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_helmet.desc=A sturdy amethyst helmet. The full set ignores bedrock and spikes.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_chestplate.desc=A sturdy amethyst chestplate. The full set ignores bedrock and spikes.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_leggings.desc=A pair of sturdy amethyst leggings. The full set ignores bedrock and spikes.
item.betteroplenty.amethyst_boots.desc=A pair of sturdy amethyst boots. The full set ignores bedrock and spikes.
item.betteroplenty.mud_pickaxe.desc=Dried mud on a stick. It will not outlast the stone it chips.
item.betteroplenty.mud_shovel.desc=Dried mud on a stick. Barely better than your hands.
item.betteroplenty.mud_axe.desc=Dried mud on a stick. The tree will probably win.
item.betteroplenty.mud_sword.desc=Dried mud on a stick. Point the blunt end at your enemy and hope.
item.betteroplenty.mud_hoe.desc=Dried mud on a stick. At least the soil is already soft.
item.betteroplenty.record_traversia.desc=A disc of Traversia. Put it in a jukebox.
item.betteroplenty.record_muddy.desc=A disc caked in dried mud. It still plays.
item.betteroplenty.dull_flower_band.desc=Clover woven into a ring. It keeps nothing out and was never meant to.
item.betteroplenty.plain_flower_band.desc=Clover and cosmos. The first band worth showing anyone.
item.betteroplenty.lush_flower_band.desc=Clover, cosmos and violets, thick enough to smell across a room.
item.betteroplenty.exotic_flower_band.desc=Four flowers and no restraint. Protects you from precisely nothing.
item.betteroplenty.mud_helmet.desc=A helmet caked from swamp mud. The full set does not drown.
item.betteroplenty.mud_chestplate.desc=A chestplate caked from swamp mud. The full set does not drown.
item.betteroplenty.mud_leggings.desc=Leggings caked from swamp mud. The full set does not drown.
item.betteroplenty.mud_boots.desc=Boots caked from swamp mud. The full set does not drown.
item.betteroplenty.wading_boots.desc=Tall boots built for wading, not walking. Ash and rotten flesh no longer drag at your feet.
item.betteroplenty.flippers.desc=Broad rubber fins, worn on the feet. Swim noticeably faster while they are on.
tile.betteroplenty.spike.cube.desc=A Phase 0 test block. It should not be in your world.
tile.betteroplenty.spike.plant.desc=A Phase 0 test plant. It should not be in your world.
tile.betteroplenty.spike.custom.desc=A Phase 0 test shape. It should not be in your world.

tile.betteroplenty.jacaranda.log.desc=A log from a jacaranda tree. Cut it into pink planks.
tile.betteroplenty.jacaranda.leaves.desc=Leaves from a jacaranda tree.
tile.betteroplenty.jacaranda.sapling.desc=Plant to grow a jacaranda tree.

worldType.betteroplenty.bop.desc=An overworld of Finally More Biomes's own biomes in place of BTA's.
worldType.betteroplenty.bop.amplified.desc=Finally More Biomes's own biomes, on terrain stretched over the whole column with the sea left low. Mountains reach the clouds and the caves go a long way down.
worldType.betteroplenty.bop.woven.desc=Finally More Biomes's biomes and BTA's own, sharing one overworld. The land is split between the two rosters in proportion to their size; the sea stays as Finally More Biomes has it.
worldType.betteroplenty.bop.woven.amplified.desc=Both rosters in one overworld, on amplified terrain.

