tile.betteroplenty.long.grass.name=Long Grass
tile.betteroplenty.long.grass.desc=Deep, unmown turf. Only the Garden grows it, and only it will hold a giant flower up.
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.stem.name=Giant Flower Stem
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.stem.desc=Five blocks of it hold a canopy of petals overhead. Not a tree, whatever it looks like.
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.red.name=Red Giant Flower
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.red.desc=Petals the size of a floor. Cut them and one in twenty leaves a rose behind.
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.yellow.name=Yellow Giant Flower
tile.betteroplenty.big.flower.yellow.desc=Wider and squatter than the red one. One in twenty cuts leaves a dandelion.

