tile.betteroplenty.willow.drape.desc=Pale strands trailed off a bayou cypress. Shears will take it down.
tile.betteroplenty.ivy.name=Ivy
tile.betteroplenty.ivy.desc=It hangs off a swamp canopy, and unlike the rest of them you can climb it.

