tile.betteroplenty.red.rock.name=Red Rock
tile.betteroplenty.red.rock.desc=A block of solid red rock.
tile.betteroplenty.red.cobble.name=Red Cobblestone
tile.betteroplenty.red.cobble.desc=Red rock, smashed apart and reconstituted.
tile.betteroplenty.red.brick.name=Red Bricks
tile.betteroplenty.red.brick.desc=Stacked bricks of red rock.
tile.betteroplenty.hard.sand.name=Hardened Sand
tile.betteroplenty.hard.sand.desc=Sand packed solid by the outback sun. It will not fall on you.
tile.betteroplenty.hard.dirt.name=Hardened Dirt
tile.betteroplenty.hard.dirt.desc=The floor of a canyon, baked past digging with a shovel.

tile.betteroplenty.apple.leaves.name=Apple Leaves
tile.betteroplenty.apple.leaves.desc=Leaves from an apple tree. Fruit ripens through the summer; punch a ripe one and catch it.
tile.betteroplenty.apple.sapling.name=Apple Sapling
tile.betteroplenty.apple.sapling.desc=Plant to grow an apple tree.

biome.betteroplenty.bop.bamboo_forest=Bamboo Forest
biome.betteroplenty.bop.tropical_rainforest=Tropical Rainforest
biome.betteroplenty.bop.rainforest=Rainforest
biome.betteroplenty.bop.tropics=Tropics
biome.betteroplenty.bop.tropics_mountain=Tropics Mountain
biome.betteroplenty.bop.fungi_forest=Fungi Forest

tile.betteroplenty.mycelium.name=Mycelium
tile.betteroplenty.mycelium.desc=Fungal soil, threaded through the ground where mushrooms grow. Dig it and you get dirt.

tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.name=Bamboo
tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.desc=A jointed green stalk. It climbs three high on grass, and four of them weave into thatching.
tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.leaves.name=Bamboo Leaves
tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.leaves.desc=Leaves from a stand of bamboo. Out of reach of a stalk, they wither.
tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.sapling.name=Bamboo Sapling
tile.betteroplenty.bamboo.sapling.desc=Plant to grow a stand of bamboo.
tile.betteroplenty.thatching.name=Bamboo Thatching
tile.betteroplenty.thatching.desc=Bamboo woven flat. Take it apart again and you get twice what you put in.

biome.betteroplenty.bop.ominous_woods=Ominous Woods
biome.betteroplenty.bop.ominous_woods_thick=Thick Ominous Woods
biome.betteroplenty.bop.dead_swamp=Dead Swamp
biome.betteroplenty.bop.quagmire=Quagmire
biome.betteroplenty.bop.sludgepit=Sludgepit
biome.betteroplenty.bop.mangrove=Mangrove
biome.betteroplenty.bop.bog=Bog

tile.betteroplenty.hardened.clay.name=Hardened Clay
tile.betteroplenty.hardened.clay.desc=Clay baked hard by a sun with nothing between it and the ground. The whole badlands is made of it.
tile.betteroplenty.stained.clay.orange.name=Orange Stained Clay
tile.betteroplenty.stained.clay.orange.desc=A seam of hardened clay that dried a shade warmer. It bands the badlands in stripes.
tile.betteroplenty.stained.clay.red.name=Red Stained Clay
tile.betteroplenty.stained.clay.red.desc=The deepest band in a badlands wall, rusted through by iron in the clay.

biome.betteroplenty.bop.badlands=Badlands
biome.betteroplenty.bop.mesa=Mesa

tile.betteroplenty.ash.name=Ash
tile.betteroplenty.ash.desc=Deadlands ash, deep enough to wade through. It smoulders, it drags at your boots, and fire laid on it never goes out.
tile.betteroplenty.ash.stone.name=Ash Stone
tile.betteroplenty.ash.stone.desc=The cold bones of a volcano, packed grey under the ash. Lava runs on it and nothing grows.
tile.betteroplenty.stalagmite.name=Stalagmite
tile.betteroplenty.stalagmite.desc=A spike of stone grown up from a cave floor.
tile.betteroplenty.stalactite.name=Stalactite
tile.betteroplenty.stalactite.desc=A spike of stone hanging from a cave ceiling.
tile.betteroplenty.quicksand.name=Quicksand
tile.betteroplenty.quicksand.desc=It looks like ground and holds you like a web. There is no floor to it.

tile.betteroplenty.bones.small.name=Small Bone
tile.betteroplenty.bones.small.desc=A rib from something that died down here. Grinds into three bonemeal.
tile.betteroplenty.bones.medium.name=Medium Bone
tile.betteroplenty.bones.medium.desc=A thicker length of the same skeleton. Grinds into six bonemeal.
tile.betteroplenty.bones.large.name=Large Bone
tile.betteroplenty.bones.large.desc=A vertebra the size of a block. Grinds into twelve bonemeal.
tile.betteroplenty.grave.name=Grave
tile.betteroplenty.grave.desc=A stone cross, standing where somebody stopped. Someone put it there.
tile.betteroplenty.grave.top.name=Grave
tile.betteroplenty.grave.top.desc=The head of a grave marker. It cannot stand without its plinth.
tile.betteroplenty.dried.dirt.name=Dried Dirt
tile.betteroplenty.dried.dirt.desc=Wasteland crust, cracked and crumbling. Bake ordinary dirt long enough and this is what is left.
tile.betteroplenty.smoldering.grass.name=Smouldering Grass
tile.betteroplenty.smoldering.grass.desc=Turf still burning from underneath. Standing on it will set you alight.

