item.betteroplenty.shroom_powder.desc=Ground toadstool. Barely a meal, and it usually turns your stomach.
item.betteroplenty.wild_carrots.desc=A carrot pulled straight from the wild. Rough on the way down.
item.betteroplenty.sunflower_seeds.desc=Seeds shaken from a sunflower head.
item.betteroplenty.salad_fruit.desc=Fruit in a bowl. The bowl comes back.
item.betteroplenty.salad_veggie.desc=Vegetables in a bowl. The bowl comes back.
item.betteroplenty.salad_shroom.desc=Mushrooms in a bowl. The bowl comes back.
item.betteroplenty.earth.desc=It is a lump of earth. You can eat it. It does nothing.
item.betteroplenty.persimmon.desc=A sweet orange fruit from an orchard tree.
item.betteroplenty.filled_honeycomb.desc=Honeycomb, still full.
item.betteroplenty.ambrosia.desc=Food of the gods. Heals at once, and returns the jar.
item.betteroplenty.turnip.desc=A humble root vegetable.

item.betteroplenty.turnip_seeds.name=Turnip Seeds
item.betteroplenty.turnip_seeds.desc=Plant them on farmland. Shaken loose from koru, one time in sixty-four.
tile.betteroplenty.turnip.crop.name=Turnips
tile.betteroplenty.turnip.crop.desc=Turnips growing on tilled earth.

