achievement.betteroplenty.scythe.desc=The grim reaper's day job.
achievement.betteroplenty.berry=Berry Picking
achievement.betteroplenty.berry.desc=The simple things in life...
achievement.betteroplenty.moss=A Rolling Stone
achievement.betteroplenty.moss.desc=It gathers none of this.
achievement.betteroplenty.thorn=Rather Thorny
achievement.betteroplenty.thorn.desc=Deadlier than cacti!
achievement.betteroplenty.coral=Nutritious
achievement.betteroplenty.coral.desc=How about a big piece of steamed coral?

